  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "v4_S5_s1686",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1686,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[scolding, warm] 您今天一口都没吃！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[genuinely surprised] Have I not?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[brave, cheeky] 您是不是……没什么朋友？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[matter-of-fact] Friends interrupt.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[unbothered, cheeky] 那讨厌的人呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[instant, with relish] Hooke.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[impressed, deadpan] 秒答。胡克定律那个胡克。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "v4_S5_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[scolding, warm] 您今天一口都没吃！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[genuinely surprised] Have I not?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[brave, cheeky] 您是不是……没什么朋友？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[matter-of-fact] Friends interrupt.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[unbothered, cheeky] 那讨厌的人呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[instant, with relish] Hooke.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[impressed, deadpan] 秒答。胡克定律那个胡克。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "v4_S6_s1686",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1686,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious, a little wary] 您在……炼金吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[evasive] I am watching a fire.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat] Go to bed.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stubborn, warm] 不走，说好陪您一天。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry, puzzled] Nobody stays a whole day.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[tired, sincere] 这么守着火，不难熬吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[plain] I have sat up longer.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 守谁？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[plain, guarded] My mother. When she was dying. Whole nights.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[warm] 您跟妈妈，一定很亲吧。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry, bitter] Close? My father died before I was born.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat, bitter] When I was three, she remarried. And left me.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stunned] 三岁？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[hard, ashamed] As a boy, I threatened to burn her and my stepfather, house and all.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[steady, then cracking] In her last illness, I changed her dressings myself.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[moved, warm] 她走了，您却没走。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
